  "body": "With no houses directly across the road, this brand-new home, built by a Master Build Award-winning builder, enjoys an open outlook and plenty of natural light.\r\nOffering approximately 194sqm of floor area, high ceilings and a practical layout, there's plenty of space for the whole family.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is bright and spacious, with direct access to the sunny front deck. The modern kitchen offers quality appliances, plenty of storage and generous bench space, making it a great space for\r\neveryday family living.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\n• 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, including a guest bedroom and full bathroom downstairs\r\n• Spacious master bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and a lovely outlook towards the reserve\r\n• Two further bedrooms upstairs, sharing a family bathroom\r\n• Second living area upstairs, ideal for a family lounge, study or children's play area\r\n• High ceilings and plenty of natural light throughout\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances and ample storage\r\n• Sunny front deck, ideal for outdoor dining or relaxing\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocated in popular Millwater, the home is close to local schools, parks and cafes, with Silverdale Shopping Centre, Orewa Beach and motorway access just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
